WEBVTT

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:51.950
To the kingdom of Forland.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:57.780
This pre-coronation party is really impressive isn't it?

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.040
The last one was just after the coup d'état.

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:02.920
His Excellency, Duke Francis of Klybel.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:05.150
His wife, Lady Joselia;

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:07.550
and their family.

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:14.240
We are indeed extremely excited; for on this occasion,

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:17.180
Prince Kaito will finally accede to the throne.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:20.410
I am happy that you were able to journey here specially for this invitation.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:23.320
I hope from now on you'll provide us with your good advice.

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.530
Please accept our sincere thanks.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:26.730
Next.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.840
Count Meshinia.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:32.910
Lady Monique.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:47.850
You're really leaving tomorrow, aren't you?

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:52.460
Yeah. We've got our reward now.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:57.660
Although her appearance may be that of a princess, inside the Master is a bounty hunter.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:01.860
If she stays with Prince Kaito, the fact that she's a fake will be exposed.

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:04.900
We'll only be separated for a short while.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:09.960
When we find out how to return you to normal, we'll come back.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.910
This is the best way, we think.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:14.030
I suppose so.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:21.490
Anyway, when the Prince's coronation is over, our job here is done.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.090
There won't be a Princess Alita anymore, will there?

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.960
You're the real princess, aren't you?

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:36.350
I'll be lonely when you all leave.

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:47.360
Jeez, I can't handle this.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:14.880
Princess! Is the Princess here? Princess!

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:16.390
Princess!

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:23.560
She's not here...

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:28.920
Good grief. What does she mean by abandoning Prince Kaito and suddenly running away like that?

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:35.360
I'm sorry. Let's go back to the hall and help Prince Kaito with his official greetings.

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.670
So is this where you were?

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:18.990
Kaito... onii-sama...

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.610
You must be running away from the party.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:23.110
Me too.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:33.920
W-Wh... Prince Kaito!!! Princess Alita!!!

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:41.210
It's been a long time since we've talked, hasn't it?

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:42.770
Yeah.

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:48.970
I heard from Jodo that when tomorrow's coronation is over, you'll be going on a journey.

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:49.810
That's right.

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:53.330
When you started talking about things like that, I was really surprised.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:58.360
Ever since you were born, you haven't taken a step out of this castle town.

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:00.450
You've been a caged princess.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:04.820
Umm, well, there are various places I wanna to check out...

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:08.210
Ah no, I mean, I would like to see.

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:11.580
Really?

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.060
I understand.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.380
If that's what you want...

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:24.320
Please come back soon.

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:26.860
I'll always be waiting for you.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.560
Thank you very much.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.720
Onii-sama.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.480
But look after yourself, especially...

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:40.200
since the Ellend Forest is very dangerous.

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:42.560
The Ellend Forest...

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:43.250
Yes.

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:49.070
The people who killed the guardian of the forest, Jitterbug...

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.730
might be in that area.

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:55.890
I'll be careful.

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:59.750
Princess! Prince!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.420
I've got something to tell you later.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:05.800
I'll send someone. Will you hear what I have to say?

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:08.530
Yes, I'll be happy to.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:19.320
Master. You were here.

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:21.970
Gramps nearly fainted when he found out you ran away.

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:23.480
I know.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:26.840
Who were you with? The prince?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.540
Yeah.

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:30.540
You in love or something?

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.040
Don't be an idiot.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:34.430
That's good then.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.170
Our job will be over tomorrow.

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:39.050
You know that, don't you?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:45.110
I know.

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:52.320
Goodness. You don't have enough awareness of your proper place.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:55.060
I know. I know; I'm at fault.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:08:00.660
Still, although it's good that you returned to the party, Kaito-sama...

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.860
If only the princess would come as well...

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:04.740
Alita is in her room.

00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:05.070
Huh?

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:08.080
We should let her rest for a bit, shouldn't we?

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:12.820
Uh, well, if you say so, Prince Kaito...

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:13.840
My apologies.

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.330
Princess...

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:22.100
I'm sorry. Please excuse me for a moment.

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:08.470
Princess!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:13.600
My name is Mirano. Princess, if you have woken up, the first thing you must do is...

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:22.350
You will have... me... my... everything...

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:27.910
So, it's a promise. Please protect us!

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:40.860
Thank goodness.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:46.760
Princess, please protect this country, won't you?

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.760
Please do!

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:50.790
Mirano.

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:12.310
Princess. I'm coming in.

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.490
Princess?

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.470
This is...

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:39.920
I didn't know this was something very important to you... I regret that I broke it.

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:42.100
Mirano, I'm sorry.

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:45.550
No...

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:48.080
It's my fault.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.550
I'm sorry.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:58.180
Princess, where did you...

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:10.850
Kaito... I mean, onii-sama is waiting in a place like this?

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.170
Yes, he's waiting impatiently.

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:22.320
There was something like this under the castle?

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.610
This way.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:48.420
Please. He's waiting in this room.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.470
You... This is the first time I've seen you, isn't it?

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.310
Still, there's something...

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.630
Stop it! What is this?

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:12.030
These really aren't the movements of the princess.

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:13.400
Who are you?

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:15.580
I'm the one asking the questions!

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:20.160
Was that... magic?

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:22.160
You're pretty nimble.

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:24.690
I hope you'll make this enjoyable.

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:30.010
Me too. I hope you won't disappoint me.

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:34.910
This... She forgot it.

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:37.070
I don't think she went out the window.

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.870
She's definitely still in the castle.

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:40.100
Please look at this!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.290
These stains are...

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.230
Lamp oil.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:00.550
It vanishes into the wall?

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:02.310
Could this possibly be...

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:04.620
Yes. A secret passage.

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:07.050
Mirano.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:11.630
You know what the Master disappearing inside here means, don't you?

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.630
Yes. Let's hurry.

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:27.400
You move very well, Princess.

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:30.400
It's because of my youth. Don't be jealous.

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:34.610
Whatever. What we really need is the key.

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:39.410
That is, we only need the exterior. What is inside doesn't matter.

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:42.410
Key? What's that?

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:48.330
Now you're finally getting serious.

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:59.520
You should thank me. This level of power won't kill you.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.880
You're the important key.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.120
Master!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.070
Princess!

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.540
Don't interfere!

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:36.000
Too late!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:50.980
What shall we do? I don't think we're at the same level as a magician that powerful.

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:54.070
Find my brother! Then we can fight with four people!

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:58.990
Brother, huh? I guess it's better than nothing.

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:03.990
Hold it right there.

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:08.810
What do you all think?

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:11.000
Our perfect disguise!

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.750
You're really dedicated, aren't you?

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:15.970
Whatever.

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:21.820
We've been searching for the location of the door for a long time, and now we've found it.

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:24.640
And the key is Princess Alita.

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:27.310
And now that you're in our grasp...

00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:29.890
Teoria is in our hands too!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:31.900
Teoria?

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:33.850
Stop it! Besides, that thing is...

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:36.400
Huh. It's too late.

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:37.610
Right, Doctor?

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:42.710
Umm. Now that we finally have the key to Teoria...

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:43.620
our—

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:54.500
Doctor?

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:26.670
The doctor's dead...

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:33.750
Bastard!!!

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:45.790
This is...

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:48.390
Pawns are just pawns, after all.

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:52.470
How presumptuous to think you could get your hands on Teoria.

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:54.190
It's already been revived?

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:57.730
My beauty and magical powers are eternal.

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:00.820
You guys fall back.

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:04.070
You're still planning to do something? It's futile.

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:05.580
Shut up.

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:10.580
No matter what, I won't retreat!

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:15.340
Where have I heard those words before?

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:37.440
What's wrong?

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:41.820
I'll kill you, goddamn bitch!

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.210
Princess!

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:08.970
I've imbued that armor with my magical powers.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.430
A normal sword can't cut through it.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:14.600
I'll kill you...

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:19.060
Amusing as this is, I'm growing tired of it.

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.420
W-What's this?

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:31.400
Princess!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:32.280
Mirano!

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:36.680
My, my, it looks like we have some <i>very</i> important guests here.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:41.300
This seems like a good opportunity to punish those who have rebelled against this country.

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:47.410
You are the rebels. This country will never do as you say!

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:48.380
Leave now!

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:53.890
How very brave of you. What could a mere maid do?

00:18:54.970 --> 00:19:00.200
I can't do anything, but there is a prince in this country who can.

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:03.820
Is Prince Kaito here? Prince Kaito!

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:08.360
It's the rebels! Prince Kaito! Where are you? Prince Kaito!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:17.670
There's no need to shout so loudly.

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:20.160
If it's Prince Kaito you're after, he's right here.

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:25.520
What?!

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.460
My, my.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:34.470
So...I wonder which of us are the real rebels?

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:41.180
Prince.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:47.150
It can't be...

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:53.160
You have conspired with Dr. Akamashi to commit treachery.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:56.650
My sister Alita has been replaced with an imposter.

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:58.450
You are all rebels!

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:07.180
It can't be... Why...

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:09.920
Why is my brother...

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.970
Seize them!

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:19.060
Pete! Let's go!

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:28.520
Calm down! Capture them!

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:36.110
Did they get away?

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:38.750
Cecilia, good job.

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:47.800
The rebels have dispersed. We are victorious!

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:53.790
Long live Prince Kaito!

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:59.730
Long live Prince Kaito! Long live Prince Kaito!

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:33.250
Long live King Kaito!
